Independent preliminary reading
================================

l044_resume read the complete working outside_route.rst. They checked that girth six forces the six neighbours of the exterior edge endpoints to occupy all six branches, yielding endpoint side sum three. They independently expanded the pair-count difference as 3 sum(a_i)-30+2(u+v)-6=3-u-v and checked all final-size formulas and necessary partial embedding restrictions. This is a working-note read only, not code review, target execution or final acceptance.
